    "created_at": "2015-11-23T16:10:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-23T16:10:40Z",
    "body": "Right, that's the same as in Blink, and I assume every browser engine ever.\n\nI did try to change Blink to be a step-by-step copy of the spec's algorithm, and that was how I discovered this issue. I think it would work fine, but it seems faster to converge on what Blink/Edge/WebKit already do.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
