    "created_at": "2015-11-24T10:04:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-24T10:05:22Z",
    "body": "So what kind of mutation record should replacing give? The same as remove/append does today? Do we really want to create special code paths just for `setAttributeNode` (and its three aliases)?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
