    "created_at": "2015-11-24T10:55:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-24T10:55:28Z",
    "body": "Judging only by the code, I think it would do the same as when `setAttribute` or `setAttributeNS` changes an existing attribute.\n\nThat's not perfect. It would be weird that you can replace the Attr node, but for mutation observers it would look like the attribute has changed, which shows that Attr isn't actually the internal representation.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
