    "created_at": "2015-11-24T15:14:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-24T15:14:24Z",
    "body": "(Maybe supply a nice summary of the issue for the people you just tagged in? What are the two behaviors, what are the practical web-facing differences, which browsers do what?)\n\nFWIW I find the spec/Gecko's behavior a decent bit less convoluted, and would kind of prefer it as such. But I am sympathetic to the shortest path to interop...\n",
